nd he's also  asked if he just wants the answer to be  out there in the public already so he  doesn't have to worry about answering  the question and here's what he said and  pay very close attention to the end i'm  just conscious of when i'm asked about  it  you know  i i i don't want to  ruin anything for fans either way  you know  do you know what i mean so i just i i'm  my answer is i  i've no i i i no comment i don't know  what's going to happen i genuinely don't  know i also you know like um  if there was a chance of that happening  in the future  i don't want to say something that could  potentially jeopardize those chances you  know because  though the people are high up in marvel  maybe they see this stuff or they hear  what i say or blah blah blah or and  maybe that influences it i don't know i  have no idea but  you know i i i i don't i i love how  passionate the fans are and i feel very  very very  touched that so many of them have gone  online and made their voices heard about  their desire for me to come back and  maybe  maybe in the future that might happen  and that would be great so who knows  we'll see  so this is perhaps one of the most  interesting things that i have heard in  an interview before specifically a  marvel character being asked about  returning as that marvel character again  charlie cox says no comment after  stuttering a lot but then he says  something that i haven't really heard  somebody say before he says that if  there was a chance of that happening in  the future meaning him returning to the  mcu or spider-man their way home he  wouldn't want to say anything to  jeopardize that now if he's already in  spider-man know we home like we believe  him to be this is actually a pretty good  statement he is basically saying hey if  i am in it i'm not trying to say  anything to mess it up but of course  only him and a handful of people know  that he is indeed in it but again we go  back to the same issue if he was not in  the movie he w